                                                "sense_id": "ceb4e1a5-e5b0-34af-a403-de65bbd8ad2c",
                                                "text": "1970, Andy Lang, \"Right Nail Hits the Spot,\" St Petersburg Times, 25 Oct., p. 5-G (retrieved 7 Dec. 2008),\nNothing prevents splitting the wood as much as first driving a pilot hole, especially for hard wood."
